0.0, 0.0, 0.0), tween_duration).set_trans(Tween.TRANS_QUINT).set_ease(Tween.EASE_IN)\n\tawait tween.finished\n```\n\nWhenever this function is called, I get an error.\n\n\"set_transform: An invalid transform was passed to physics body '@AnimateableBody3D'. The basis of the transform was singular, which is not supported by Jolt Physics. This is likely caused by one or more axes having a scale of zero. The basis (and thus its scale) will be treated as identity.\n\nEDIT: I fixed the warning itself, however the original issue of not being able to disable Jolt Physics warnings stands.\n\nThere's an option to turn off all warnings but it doesn't turn off Jolt Physics warnings.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nExplained above.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108529/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api